 drivers/infiniband/hw/mthca/mthca_memfree.c |  6 +++---
 drivers/infiniband/hw/qib/qib_user_pages.c  | 11 ++++-------
 drivers/infiniband/hw/qib/qib_user_sdma.c   |  6 +++---
